# PostgreSQL

Create an empty PostgreSQL database and set `DATABASE_URL` in `apps/server/.env.local`.
The generated {{#if isPrismaOrm}}Prisma{{else}}Drizzle{{/if}} migration owns the schema. Run `{{packageManagerRunCommand}} db:setup`
before the first development or production start and whenever deploying to a fresh database.

Use a dedicated database user in deployed environments and require TLS according to your
PostgreSQL provider's connection guidance.
